This template contains code, configuration, CI workflows, documentation, and
example settings for setting up a city CityGML repository. All template
content is licensed under the Apache License 2.0 (see LICENSE).

City repositories generated from this template MUST, before adding data:
1. Replace this NOTICE with the city dataset's own provenance record:
   source URL, acquisition date, original license, required attribution, and
   the list of modifications made to the original data.
2. Extend LICENSE with the licensing terms of the city data (keep the
   Apache-2.0 section for code; add a dataset section). The
   sample-*-station repositories are worked examples of both files.
3. Record how contributed data and images are licensed in
   docs/data-contribution-policy.md.
